# Drop GGUF whisper.cpp models here.
#
# Filename convention: ggml-<size>[.lang].bin
#   ggml-tiny.bin       75 MB
#   ggml-base.bin       142 MB
#   ggml-small.bin      466 MB
#   ggml-medium.bin     1.5 GB
#   ggml-large-v3.bin   2.9 GB
#   ggml-large-v3-turbo.bin   1.5 GB (8× speed of large-v3)
#
# Quantized variants (smaller + faster, slight quality drop):
#   ggml-<size>-q5_0.bin
#   ggml-<size>-q8_0.bin
#
# Canonical source: huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp
# Models are intentionally NOT vendored (license + size).
